    "UIName": "Solahma SLM-LRM",
    "Id": "mechdef_solahma_SLM-LRM",
    "Name": "Solahma SLM-LRM",
    "Details": "The newest of the Word of Blake's Demon Series of battle armor is the Nephilim. Named for a group of half-angels from the bible who dwelt with mortals, the name may hint at the unit's intended close relationship with the Celestial series. Like the Celestial series, the Nephilim employs modular and/or detachable weapon mounts to give it a flexibility few other Demon series suits possess.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.904</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#2aad3b>Can only be transported by internal bays, can melee, can not swarm.</b></color>",
    "Icon": "BA_Nephilim"
  },
